## Whole-file declarations, data, registration and contextual obligations (unit-1)

This Test262 file calls String.raw with a plain template object whose raw.length is NaN, stores the returned string, and asserts SameValue with the empty string. String.cpp registers raw as the self-hosted String_static_raw function. That implementation converts the call site and raw property to objects, applies ToLength to raw.length, then immediately returns an empty string for zero segments before reading raw[0] or substitutions. reportCompare(0,0) is the harness completion comparison, not the behavior assertion. The file defines no local functions or asynchronous work.


